[[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K41</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Loosen the band and disconnect the the turbocharger air inlet\nsleeve from the rigid pipe, air flow  meter side.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064832.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Remove the air filter (1a) complete with air flow meter (1b)\nby releasing from the underlying pins and then from the rear fastenings.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064833.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connections from the heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40C</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40D</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo and remove the glow plugs.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064834.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the heater plugs in their seats and tighten them to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>GLOW PLUGS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 0.9 ÷ 1.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connections to the heater plugs.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40C</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Heater plugs</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A40D</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064835.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<p>Fit the air filter complete with air flow\nmeter in place.</p><p>Connect the air intake sleeve to the turbocharger,\nair flow meter side, and tighten the band.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K41</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]